        "Description": "June 30th, 2006\r\rSapienza, Costiera Amalfitana, Italia.\r\rCiao, agente 47. The next five targets are five of my former soldati; Riccardo Castagnoli, Lucanio &quot;Luca&quot; Billione, Matteo Arturi, Mattia Fiorio &amp; Camelia Lorenzo. Kill them all and who ever stands in your way. If you wanna know the easiest way to kill them, that is explosives and heavy weapons. When you are done with these five stronzi traditori then there&apos;s only seventy-five left.\r\rGrazie mille, agente 47.\r\r-&apos;Don&apos; Angelo Corleone.",
